sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Usuario
    participant mainForm as mainForm : MainForm
    participant frm as frm : LoginForm
    participant activityBLL as activityBLL : ActivityBLL
    participant activityMPP as activityMPP : ActivityMPP
    participant dal as dal : AccessDAL
    participant bd as Base de Datos

    Note over Usuario,bd: CU-02 Logout - flujo básico (pasos 1 a 3)

    Usuario->>mainForm: Selecciona "Cerrar Sesión" del menú principal
    mainForm-->>frm: ShowDialog() retorna DialogResult.OK
    frm->>frm: AppPreferencesBLL.SavePreferences(language: string, theme: string): void
    frm->>frm: SessionManagerBLL.RemoveSession(userId: int): void
    frm->>activityBLL: LogLogout(userId: int, description: string): void
    activityBLL->>activityMPP: Save(log: ActivityLogBE): bool
    activityMPP->>dal: Save(operacion: string, parameters: SqlParameter[]): bool
    dal->>bd: Registro de auditoría de cierre de sesión
    bd-->>dal: 1 fila afectada
    dal-->>activityMPP: true
    activityMPP-->>activityBLL: true
    frm->>frm: CultureHelperBLL.SetCulture(languageCode: string): void
    frm->>frm: ApplyResources(): void
    frm->>frm: ThemeHelper.ApplyTheme(root: Control, themeCode: string): void
    frm-->>Usuario: Muestra la pantalla de inicio de sesión con los campos vacíos
